/**
 * Fresh-install / reinstall bake for the families the "coop" wave owns (called from
 * buildGameSetupScript in worker/game-variant.ts, in one delimited block). The values the setup
 * script already declares as `-e KEY=` are substituted by applyGameConfigEnv (these families now carry
 * `envKey` in lib/game-config.ts where the schema key differs from the env name); this adds the
